00:37:27.940 --> 00:37:30.389
good at it, and we have a plan to

00:37:31.269 --> 00:37:33.359
develop the course with you —

00:37:34.359 --> 00:37:38.489
to collaborate with you. It's something we stole from Stanley and Alison.

00:37:39.099 --> 00:37:43.169
You know? Let the students design the course and I can relax and

00:37:43.869 --> 00:37:45.579
eat ....

00:37:45.579 --> 00:37:47.410
chili rellenos ...

00:37:47.410 --> 00:37:49.410
more often, okay?

00:37:49.450 --> 00:37:51.400
So, our dream is

00:37:51.400 --> 00:37:55.889
that we work with you, and we work with each other. So the professors will be meeting

00:37:56.470 --> 00:38:01.079
every lunchtime, after our yoga practice, which everyone's going to do.

00:38:01.900 --> 00:38:05.789
Someone was telling me today how much their body hurts and why they can't do yoga,

00:38:06.819 --> 00:38:08.819
And I'm like, duh!

00:38:10.839 --> 00:38:15.359
But uh ... come and sit on the mat and do something, you know?

00:38:18.079 --> 00:38:19.269
It's okay,

00:38:19.269 --> 00:38:24.609
you don't have to do everything that everybody else does. Forget everybody else, do some stretching,

00:38:24.920 --> 00:38:32.440
let the body get blood, you know? Be healthier. Okay? After yoga we will have an hour lunch

00:38:33.260 --> 00:38:36.160
with the professors, but we want your feedback

00:38:36.880 --> 00:38:44.700
how to make this a cool course, and how to teach it more effectively. Okay? You're the first experiment, you're the laboratory,

00:38:45.320 --> 00:38:47.600
but we want the laboratory rats

00:38:48.140 --> 00:38:51.160
to tell us what they like, what they don't like,

00:38:51.680 --> 00:38:58.149
how they think we can improve the teacher training. So we're kind of keeping it fluid, what we realized already

00:38:59.239 --> 00:39:01.989
is that you cannot teach a teacher

00:39:03.289 --> 00:39:05.289
for a week and let them go.

00:39:05.769 --> 00:39:08.049
That would be like training a heart surgeon

00:39:08.690 --> 00:39:11.979
in a week and giving them a razor blade and saying,

00:39:12.710 --> 00:39:14.710
"Go for it!" Okay?

00:39:16.309 --> 00:39:18.309
So we kind of made a decision,

00:39:19.279 --> 00:39:25.209
which is negotiable, okay? Because you're all helping us develop it, this course ...

00:39:26.660 --> 00:39:28.800
we think, come to three courses and

00:39:29.360 --> 00:39:33.840
then we talk about certifying you for the first one. Okay? Got it?

00:39:33.840 --> 00:39:37.120
And you don't have to do them in order if you're from South Africa.

00:39:37.660 --> 00:39:39.340
Welcome.

00:39:39.349 --> 00:39:43.568
There's been an underground ACI group in South Africa for a hundred years,

00:39:44.269 --> 00:39:47.498
we finally met after, I don't know, 20 years ...

00:39:48.920 --> 00:39:53.319
but ... you know, you ... you can ... you're welcome

00:39:54.229 --> 00:39:58.239
to help design the course, help us design the course, and I think

00:39:59.509 --> 00:40:01.509
it's going to take three

00:40:02.059 --> 00:40:03.289
courses

00:40:03.289 --> 00:40:05.340
to really give you enough foundation

00:40:06.100 --> 00:40:12.420
to give you a "razor blade" and to go say, "do heart operations." Okay? And they don't have to be in order.

00:40:12.429 --> 00:40:14.000
Well, see if you're from South Africa

00:40:14.019 --> 00:40:21.699
come come next year, and the year after. Now, the answer to the question Geshe-la try to talk about the questions, okay?

00:40:23.180 --> 00:40:27.579
Is that anyone can teach ACI. Anyone!

00:40:28.290 --> 00:40:33.840
The courses are free online. The materials are free online. We locked them. You can't change them. Hehe.

00:40:35.109 --> 00:40:37.169
Unless you retype them or something, okay?

00:40:38.590 --> 00:40:44.729
Anyone is welcome to teach what we call "living room courses". Okay? And ideally

00:40:45.609 --> 00:40:47.609
less than 15 people ...

00:40:47.920 --> 00:40:49.920
in a living room and

00:40:50.109 --> 00:40:52.289
you came to one class at ACI,

00:40:52.960 --> 00:40:58.679
you can, you're very welcome to share it with your friends. Okay, there's no

00:40:59.980 --> 00:41:06.119
limits on the materials, you can use the materials, you can ... you're welcome to share with friends. I

00:41:06.940 --> 00:41:10.080
expect you to teach at least one ACI

00:41:11.140 --> 00:41:16.500
Course 1 class on the airplane on the way home to the person sitting next to you.

00:41:17.500 --> 00:41:20.369
Okay? And that, you don't have to come to three

00:41:21.430 --> 00:41:25.470
courses to have permission to do that. Okay, everyone in the world has permission to

00:41:26.200 --> 00:41:29.399
sit down with their friends in their living room. I know the Guadalajara

00:41:30.730 --> 00:41:32.730
skyscraper penthouse

00:41:33.760 --> 00:41:35.080
karma.

00:41:35.080 --> 00:41:37.590
They have this karma to have the most beautiful

00:41:38.770 --> 00:41:40.770
floor in the city.

00:41:40.780 --> 00:41:48.179
It was given to them for their classes with a swimming pool on it at the top of the building and

00:41:48.490 --> 00:41:50.729
the bar they don't go to okay? And ...

00:41:52.300 --> 00:41:55.229
so, you're welcome to sit in your living room and,

00:41:55.930 --> 00:41:57.930
and teach friends, okay?

00:41:58.810 --> 00:42:00.810
if your country

00:42:00.850 --> 00:42:02.740
does not allow

00:42:02.740 --> 00:42:05.459
religious teaching, even in a living room,

00:42:06.880 --> 00:42:14.490
you're still welcome to take this training and we ask you to teach it outside of your country. Okay? If your country doesn't allow

00:42:15.760 --> 00:42:20.219
these kinds of teaching in that country we require

00:42:20.859 --> 00:42:24.749
that you go to another location if you want to teach.

00:42:24.750 --> 00:42:30.209
Okay? And if I find out that people, who are in a country where it's not allowed, are

00:42:30.880 --> 00:42:37.680
endangering themselves or other people, I will remove your certification. Okay? So, clear?

00:42:38.590 --> 00:42:43.120
Alright. And it's possible, in English they say, "where there's a will, there's a way".

00:42:44.570 --> 00:42:49.900
If you love people enough, you will find a way to do it legally and correctly.

00:42:49.940 --> 00:42:53.920
Okay? And I don't want anyone getting in trouble. Alright? Okay.

00:42:55.430 --> 00:42:58.839
So that's .. what kinds of people can teach ACI? The answer is ...

00:43:00.050 --> 00:43:05.439
anybody — if you have a head, even without a head, if you can find a way to express yourself ...

00:43:08.420 --> 00:43:10.370
Okay?

00:43:10.370 --> 00:43:18.249
"Certified" teacher has to come to the training. Certified teacher, who's listed on the website as a certified teacher,

00:43:18.560 --> 00:43:24.130
you ... we have to train you. Okay? You have to go through the training. Okay? How many classes you have to come?

00:43:24.130 --> 00:43:26.739
How many course do you have to come to? How much can you do online?

00:43:27.260 --> 00:43:29.260
You know? How much can you do by ...

00:43:30.200 --> 00:43:32.200
touching your head with another teacher ...

00:43:33.770 --> 00:43:39.130
ee have to decide this week. Maybe you can help us with suggestions. We have to make it possible

00:43:40.280 --> 00:43:42.280
for people to get the training

00:43:43.130 --> 00:43:46.719
from South Africa or whatever. We were, we are working on

00:43:47.510 --> 00:43:49.959
finding ways to certify teachers

00:43:50.480 --> 00:43:57.430
With a responsible mix of online and in-person. How that's going to happen is pretty much up to this group,

00:43:57.470 --> 00:43:59.470
especially the professors, okay?

00:44:00.260 --> 00:44:02.260
Mentors. So ...

00:44:02.810 --> 00:44:08.199
to teach "officially", groups of over 15, outside of your living room,

00:44:09.080 --> 00:44:10.520
including online,

00:44:10.520 --> 00:44:16.120
if it's over 15 people you must be certified — and you will be on a list of

00:44:16.670 --> 00:44:22.119
certified teachers, and and what courses you're certified for, if we do it that way,

00:44:22.630 --> 00:44:25.509
will also be online. It will be on our website. Okay?

00:44:27.590 --> 00:44:28.730
And

00:44:28.730 --> 00:44:34.780
we'll talk more about that whole process. There's a lot of questions you probably have, and don't stress about it.

00:44:35.050 --> 00:44:38.860
I can't cover everything the first night. I got to do the homework,

00:44:39.560 --> 00:44:42.880
but it'll be a cool system. You will like it.

00:44:42.880 --> 00:44:49.479
We want you to teach — we desperately want you to teach and you are very valuable. The people who came here

00:44:49.940 --> 00:44:57.339
to learn to be a teacher — it took me 40 years to find you, and I'm proud of each one of you for coming and

00:44:57.859 --> 00:45:02.889
I'm going to make you a good teacher. Okay? So, that's the goal. Don't worry about it,

00:45:03.589 --> 00:45:05.589
but I'm going make you a good teacher.

00:45:06.710 --> 00:45:08.210
Okay ...

00:45:08.210 --> 00:45:12.740
So, certified teachers—groups of 15 or more, "official"

00:45:13.620 --> 00:45:16.160
ACI teacher, you got to be certified, your name will be on a list.

00:45:16.820 --> 00:45:21.640
"What if I've been teaching for 20 years Geshela, and you never told me I needed this stuff?"

