00:45:44.329 --> 00:45:46.629
Just to make sure the quality of the teaching is good.

00:45:47.480 --> 00:45:49.069
Accurate, okay?

00:45:49.069 --> 00:45:50.869
Accessible and ...

00:45:50.869 --> 00:45:52.869
relevant. Nice! Okay ...

