which always gets people's attention for a while, is

00:46:49.279 --> 00:46:52.149
ACI Foundation Courses. The 18

00:46:53.329 --> 00:46:55.329
ACI

00:46:55.400 --> 00:46:57.730
Foundation Courses. Okay? That's half of

