okay? But, so far you just got a name, right?

00:47:11.789 --> 00:47:12.930
18

00:47:12.930 --> 00:47:14.069
ACI

00:47:14.069 --> 00:47:16.069
Foundation Courses, okay?

00:47:16.230 --> 00:47:23.149
By the way, just ... you probably, most of you know, the last three: 16, 17, and 18 are

00:47:24.839 --> 00:47:27.409
review of the first 15, okay?

