Now, the second 18 courses are

00:47:33.180 --> 00:47:35.069
Dimond Way

00:47:35.069 --> 00:47:38.419
Courses. And the Sanskrit is Vajrayana. Okay?

00:47:39.180 --> 00:47:41.839
Diamond Way Courses right, the goal ...

00:47:43.109 --> 00:47:44.430
okay ...

00:47:44.430 --> 00:47:50.210
traditionally if you study those first 18 courses, and you work hard,

00:47:50.910 --> 00:47:57.769
you can become a Buddha and help all those stars we were talking about in about a billion years.

