Standard

00:48:01.739 --> 00:48:03.739
time period

00:48:03.779 --> 00:48:10.069
for a normal Buddha. Okay? I mean, I can't even count the number — call it a billion. It's probably too small.

00:48:11.519 --> 00:48:13.519
If you study Diamond Way —

00:48:14.849 --> 00:48:18.288
properly, accurately, accessibly, and

00:48:20.309 --> 00:48:21.599
relevantly—

00:48:21.599 --> 00:48:29.268
You can shorten that time to this lifetime — to one lifetime. Okay? And that's an incredible deal!

00:48:30.690 --> 00:48:33.470
You know? That's a good deal! Okay?

00:48:35.099 --> 00:48:42.558
But, it takes a lot of training to do the second 18 courses and as teachers I

00:48:43.739 --> 00:48:45.150
expect you

00:48:45.150 --> 00:48:46.710
to never

00:48:46.710 --> 00:48:49.909
teach a person the second eighteen courses without the ...

00:48:50.940 --> 00:48:54.649
first eighteen courses. It's like giving a kid a loaded gun.

00:48:55.769 --> 00:48:58.849
Okay? They will hurt themselves. Okay? So, I ...

00:49:00.210 --> 00:49:04.759
Okay? And I've tried, I said "oh, this person is special."

00:49:05.549 --> 00:49:08.299
"I'll tell you what, you finish 12 courses, I'll give you the Vajrayana."

00:49:08.970 --> 00:49:12.619
They all failed! I think the failure rate for people who didn't finish

00:49:12.619 --> 00:49:17.459
the first 18 courses is close to a hundred percent, and I'm talking big failures.

00:49:17.460 --> 00:49:22.859
Okay? Hurt people, messed up people's lives, messed up their own lives, okay?

00:49:23.499 --> 00:49:25.499
Not cool. Okay? So,

00:49:26.529 --> 00:49:30.299
Vajrayana is fast. There's a there's a Sanskrit word for those courses

00:49:31.059 --> 00:49:34.679
called Tantra. Okay? We're not going to use the word

00:49:35.589 --> 00:49:38.129
because it has a bad reputation in the world,

00:49:38.650 --> 00:49:41.129
even in India. Okay? The word Tantra

00:49:41.650 --> 00:49:44.369
has bad reputation in the world, because of

00:49:44.979 --> 00:49:47.189
misbehavior — bad behavior of

00:49:48.069 --> 00:49:52.439
teachers who were practicing other kinds of Tantra. I was in

00:49:54.910 --> 00:49:59.339
Indonesia, no sorry. Close. Argentina, and

00:50:00.970 --> 00:50:05.939
we have somebody for Argentina, where are you? Yeah, a couple — so anyway I was

00:50:07.059 --> 00:50:11.548
asked to go to Uruguay and teach in ... what it called, Punta Del Este?

00:50:12.489 --> 00:50:14.489
To a soccer team,

00:50:14.890 --> 00:50:22.469
and it was cool, you know? And I did it and it was fun. This is the Monte Carlo of South America, right? And

00:50:23.200 --> 00:50:29.219
it was on the beach and everything, but they were so cool. We worked until two o'clock at night together, and

00:50:30.219 --> 00:50:32.219
on the ... in the airport ...

00:50:32.799 --> 00:50:34.479
Montevideo?

00:50:34.479 --> 00:50:36.069
What's it called?

00:50:36.069 --> 00:50:37.869
Uruguay.

00:50:37.869 --> 00:50:45.058
Yeah ... in the airport I saw, there's a huge poster in the bookstore it said, "Tantra secrets, sex,

00:50:46.150 --> 00:50:48.569
killing chickens", you know? And I was like ...

00:50:49.390 --> 00:50:53.759
we can't use this word, you know? So, I encourage you not to use this word

00:50:53.799 --> 00:50:57.419
okay? Especially as an ACI teacher, there's a traditional name of

00:50:58.239 --> 00:51:00.539
the higher teachings — advanced teachings

00:51:01.119 --> 00:51:08.699
called Vajrayana—Diamond Way, and I prefer to use it. Tim pointed out to me that there's a Buddhist group calling themselves Diamond Way nowadays,

00:51:09.819 --> 00:51:13.409
but, and there's a group calling themselves Kadampa also. That's fine,

00:51:14.259 --> 00:51:17.909
I'm not going to avoid an important word because someone's using it. Okay?

00:51:18.609 --> 00:51:21.268
So, you know what it means. It means a method

00:51:22.719 --> 00:51:29.699
to help the whole universe in your lifetime. Okay? And to be honest, you don't want to

00:51:30.520 --> 00:51:32.520
go through the billion years

00:51:32.920 --> 00:51:34.240
anyway!

00:51:34.240 --> 00:51:41.040
Okay? It's too much trouble. You got to die. You got to get diarrhea I don't know how many times.

00:51:42.640 --> 00:51:45.180
You know? Don't do it! Just

00:51:45.790 --> 00:51:49.769
plan on doing the second 18 courses, they are called the Diamond Way Courses.

00:51:50.140 --> 00:51:57.509
Sometimes I call them Advanced Courses, but I thought it was too wimpy. They're not advanced courses, they're ultimate courses.

00:51:58.180 --> 00:52:04.649
Okay? Diamond Way Courses, AND in my opinion—which is modest. In my opinion,

00:52:05.290 --> 00:52:09.989
because I wrote them, they are the best Vajrayana courses in history.

00:52:10.570 --> 00:52:17.999
They include every major topic of Vajrayana for the first time in one course. I ... I was at

00:52:18.520 --> 00:52:22.530
the two Vajrayana monasteries of Tibet, and

00:52:23.050 --> 00:52:26.969
I was there the night they started the debate ground. I debated

00:52:28.330 --> 00:52:33.989
all the students in the Vajrayana monastery, and kicked their butt frankly ...

00:52:35.770 --> 00:52:37.090
And

00:52:37.090 --> 00:52:40.979
they don't have a good course as we have. Okay, I don't care.

00:52:41.740 --> 00:52:47.370
Okay, this is the best in the world. Okay? So cool. Super cool. You can do it. Okay?

00:52:48.040 --> 00:52:52.290
Vajrayana. Eighteen courses, so you got the answer to the question, right?

00:52:53.350 --> 00:52:55.350
It's pretty simple.

00:52:55.390 --> 00:52:57.390
You're not going to put

00:52:58.120 --> 00:53:04.739
"Tantra" courses, and you're not going to call them that because people will get the wrong idea. Even in India, that word is very very ...

00:53:06.490 --> 00:53:13.560
It ... for all Indian people it's very uncomfortable to use the word tantra, because of people who misused it

00:53:13.560 --> 00:53:19.620
okay? So, so stick to Diamond Way. I don't want to see "Advanced Courses" on your homework!

00:53:20.860 --> 00:53:22.860
They're better than that!

00:53:22.900 --> 00:53:24.900
Okay? Alright ...

00:53:27.900 --> 00:53:30.380
You guys okay? I'm going to go ...

00:53:31.620 --> 00:53:36.260
straight through. I'm older than you, I have to stand up the whole time. I'm teaching three hours in the morning,

00:53:37.780 --> 00:53:39.780
I'll go like this maybe ...

00:53:40.469 --> 00:53:42.469
but if you have a

00:53:42.749 --> 00:53:44.670
pee-pee emergency,

00:53:44.670 --> 00:53:51.229
you are very welcome to just slip out, rather than taking it a ten-minute break that turns into a half-hour break.

00:53:51.229 --> 00:53:53.229
Okay? We don't have much time together,

00:53:53.729 --> 00:53:55.729
so if you have a ...

00:53:56.249 --> 00:53:58.249
I took my old lady to the ballet

00:53:58.829 --> 00:54:00.829
this week in Phoenix.

00:54:02.099 --> 00:54:09.498
Getting her out of her nursing home, getting her into the car, getting her into her wheelchair, we were the last people in

00:54:10.200 --> 00:54:13.009
the auditorium and they were waiting for us.

00:54:14.579 --> 00:54:17.238
And I worked hard to get in there on time,

00:54:17.940 --> 00:54:22.820
and she sat down they started to lower the lights and she said very loudly,

00:54:25.559 --> 00:54:27.559
"I need to pee!"

00:54:28.440 --> 00:54:30.299
And i'm like ...

00:54:30.299 --> 00:54:34.998
already all the ushers are angry at us, you know? And I'm like, "alright".

00:54:36.119 --> 00:54:43.068
You know? I've put her in her wheelchair and they waited for 15 minutes, you know? A huge auditorium

00:54:44.640 --> 00:54:47.779
they waited for her for ... why did I mention that? Oh

00:54:49.349 --> 00:54:57.258
I'm not going to take a break. It's too slow. Okay? Alright? Two hours straight through, you okay with that? But seriously, it's not

00:54:57.869 --> 00:54:59.869
disrespectful, it's not wrong.

00:55:00.809 --> 00:55:07.429
It's wrong to hurt your body. Okay? In Buddhism. So, if you ... if something ... if you drank a couple

00:55:08.910 --> 00:55:10.940
sodas before the class,

00:55:12.089 --> 00:55:16.609
just go and don't ask me, and don't look desperate. Okay?

00:55:17.849 --> 00:55:19.170
Just ...

00:55:19.170 --> 00:55:22.399
Just go. Okay. Phil's showing you the way

00:55:23.099 --> 00:55:25.459
Okay. Alright next topic.

