In the very short run, my thinking when I started the ACI courses was to ...

00:55:36.599 --> 00:55:42.679
share the Geshe course with, with modern people outside of Tibet, you see? And

00:55:43.589 --> 00:55:47.089
I was very excited. I was finishing my

